# M19-W5: the build context Fly's builder uploads is only the Dockerfile and what it copies. Without this
# list it was the whole tree, the venv, the git history and the owner's artifact included.
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!requirements/serve.lock
!requirements/build.lock
!src
# What git ignores under src/ stays out too: a local secret file, bytecode (the M19 security review's S14).
**/.env*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
!build/hosted/advisor.db
